# Pairs with EveryCommitAudited. BeginAsync swallows its own write failure
# instead of refusing the call, so the mutation commits with no intent and no
# record: nothing the reconciler could ever find.
MODULE: AuditIntentFailureProceeds
TARGET: EveryCommitAudited
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a failed intent write lets the call go on to commit
PERTURBS: BeginIntent

--- FIND
       ELSE /\ pending' = pending
            /\ op' = [op EXCEPT ![o] = [@ EXCEPT !.pc = "done", !.result = "unavailable"]]
--- REPLACE
       ELSE /\ pending' = pending
\* MUTATION: the call proceeds without its intent.
            /\ op' = [op EXCEPT ![o] = [@ EXCEPT !.pc = "intent", !.live = TRUE, !.base = Obs, !.mark = Len(hist), !.actor = op[o].caller]]
--- END
